# n8n-workflow pulls @n8n/expression-runtime -> isolated-vm, a native addon with no
# prebuilt binary for current Node. We only need n8n-workflow's types and error classes,
# and neither loads isolated-vm, so skip install scripts rather than requiring a toolchain.
#
# Caveat: this also suppresses our own prepublishOnly hook. Run the release gate
# explicitly before publishing:
#
#   npm run prepublishOnly && npm publish --access public
ignore-scripts=true
